# Copy this file to .env.local (already gitignored) and fill in the value below.
# Do not commit .env.local or paste this value anywhere outside your local machine.

# Your Roblox account's ".ROBLOSECURITY" session cookie. When set, download-icons.js
# and the local dev asset server fetch full-resolution originals from
# assetdelivery.roblox.com (authenticated as you) instead of downscaled thumbnails —
# only works for assets you have access to (e.g. ones you uploaded).
#
# To find it: open roblox.com in your browser while logged in, open DevTools ->
# Application/Storage -> Cookies -> https://www.roblox.com -> copy the value of
# the ".ROBLOSECURITY" cookie.
#
# Leave unset to fall back to the existing thumbnail-based download (no auth needed).
ROBLOSECURITY=
